Task: maximum
Given an array arr of integers and a non-negative integer k, return a sorted list of length k with the maximum k numbers in arr.

Definitions (Lean):
@[reducible, simp]
def maximum_precond (arr : List Int) (k : Nat) : Prop :=
  k ≤ arr.length

@[reducible, simp]
def maximum_postcond (arr : List Int) (k : Nat) (result: List Int) (h_precond : maximum_precond (arr) (k)) :=
  result.isPerm ((arr.mergeSort (fun a b => a ≥ b)).take k) ∧ ∀ i, i < result.length - 1 → result[i]! ≤ result[i + 1]!

Goal 1: find ρ : List Int
arr : List ℤ
k : ℕ
h_precond : maximum_precond arr k
⊢ ∃ ρ, maximum_postcond arr k ρ h_precond

